When in range, pressing a key (say, E or a mobile-friendly on-screen button) triggers gather
This should call into your existing Dictionary<string,int> inventory system — same inventory["Stick"] += amount pattern you already built, just triggered by proximity+keypress instead of a menu button

5. Node depletion (optional but good to nail now)

Node disappears or goes on cooldown after gathering, so the loop feels like real gathering, not an infinite button press

